action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P88 on Android: hover rows (a touch screen has no move), Command held through one hover,
# then a drag. Expected: "pointer" at the last hover, "last with cmd" at the held one,
# "drags: 2" (the drag, then the 2026-10-15 long press below). The panel spans about x 18-377, y 131-371 points.
# Android 上的 P88:用 hover 列(觸控螢幕沒有 move),其中一次 hover 按住 Command,然後拖曳一次。
sleep,,,,,,2000000,let P88 lay out,android
hover,150,200,,,,,into the panel,android
sleep,,,,,,300000,,android
keydown,,,,,command,,hold Command,android
sleep,,,,,,300000,,android
hover,170,220,,,,,hover with Command held,android
sleep,,,,,,300000,,android
keyup,,,,,command,,,android
sleep,,,,,,300000,,android
mousedown,100,300,,left,,,drag on the panel,android
sleep,,,,,,400000,,android
mouseup,200,300,,left,,,,android
sleep,,,,,,400000,,android
hover,200,190,,,,,end inside the panel,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,let the readout redraw,android
# A finger held 0.8 s on the panel, then moved 100 points right while still down (2026-10-15):
# the hold is hover on a touch screen (the system long-press timeout, 400 ms by default), so
# "last active" moves with the finger and the lift shows "pointer: ended". A `move` row inside a
# press is posted as ACTION_MOVE. The same press is also a drag on the panel: "drags" goes up by one.
# 手指在面板上按住 0.8 秒，仍按著向右移 100 點(2026-10-15):觸控螢幕上按住系統長按逾時(預設 400 毫秒)即是
# hover,所以「last active」跟著手指移動，放開後顯示「pointer: ended」。按壓之內的 `move` 列以 ACTION_MOVE 投遞。
# 同一次按壓也是面板上的拖曳:「drags」加一。
mousedown,120,260,,left,,,hold on the panel,android
sleep,,,,,,800000,longer than the long-press timeout,android
move,170,260,,,,,the finger moves while held,android
sleep,,,,,,100000,,android
move,220,260,,,,,,android
sleep,,,,,,300000,,android
mouseup,220,260,,left,,,lift: hover ends,android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,let the readout redraw,android
